      "note": "Any number of ChatGPT subscriptions on the same accounts page as Claude (chatgpt-connection #6; engine ghcr.io/humanitylabs-org/wizard-chatgpt:0.2.6@sha256:72be4ede5a2e0151eea3a9050611352b0b14c044e56c1202a25442f4003552e3, amd64+arm64, wizard-app-store #33+#36 at 81758d58, run 40465361129). 0.2.4 plus design rules v0 page (wizard-app-store #34) and Home names Hermes' default sign-in labels 'ChatGPT', 'ChatGPT 2' (#33). Sign-ins run inside the agent (stock `hermes auth add openai-codex` through the wizard-os plugin broker); an unreachable agent is reported with Retry. Claude is installed by default as its own `claude-subscription` row below."
