      "note": "Any number of Claude subscriptions (claude-connection #6; engine ghcr.io/humanitylabs-org/wizard-claude:0.2.8@sha256:7e7956086a2f8810b46666e5948c71ffc2637e1e54566eaffb100fb8acdc406c, amd64+arm64, wizard-app-store #33+#36 at 81758d58, run 40465361122). 0.2.6 plus design rules v0 page (#34); the original Claude Code sign-in and an agent row merge only on the agent's exact emailHash (Agent Service #196/#203), masked-email matching only for older agent services (#33). Added subscriptions sign in inside the agent (stock `hermes auth add anthropic`) through the wizard-os plugin broker. Alongside with host Hermes on a claude-subscription provider: App Manager still binds the agent's own Claude Code login folder at the engine's /claude; tokens are never copied."
